[31m-## [2.2.0] - 2026-08-24[m
[32m+[m[32m#### Added[m
[32m+[m[32m- Unified CLI entry point at `src/truss_analysis/main.py`[m
[32m+[m[32m- Comprehensive test suite (39 tests, 90.5% coverage)[m
[32m+[m[32m- GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline (pytest, ruff, mypy)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Backward compatibility for legacy JSON schemas with space-padded keys[m
[32m+[m[32m- Pre-commit hooks for code quality enforcement[m
 [m
[31m-### Added[m
[31m-- Dynamic versioning with `setuptools_scm`[m
[31m-- Version automatically read from git tags[m
[31m-- `_version.py` auto-generated at build time[m
[32m+[m[32m#### Changed[m
[32m+[m[32m- **BREAKING:** Removed root-level `main.py` shim (use `python -m truss_analysis.main` instead)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Migrated to `src/` layout for proper package structure[m
[32m+[m[32m- Pinned all dependencies in `pyproject.toml`[m
 [m
[31m-### Changed[m
[31m-- Coverage threshold: 90% -> 85% (matches actual coverage)[m
[31m-- Improved CI/CD workflow[m
[32m+[m[32m#### Fixed[m
[32m+[m[32m- JSON schema tolerance for legacy files (e.g., `example1.json`)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Coverage tracking for CLI execution paths[m
[32m+[m[32m- Type hints and mypy compliance across all modules[m
 [m
[31m-## [2.1.9] - 2026-08-24[m
